":20,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":21,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":22,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":23,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":24,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":25,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":26,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":27,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":28,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":29,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":30,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":31,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":32,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":33,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":34,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":35,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":36,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":37,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":38,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":39,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":40,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":41,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":42,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":43,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":44,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":45,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":46,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":47,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":48,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":49,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":50,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":51,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":52,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":53,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":54,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":55,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":56,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":57,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":58,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":59,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":60,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":61,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":62,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":63,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":64,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":65,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":66,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":67,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":68,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":69,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":70,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":71,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":72,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":73,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":74,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":75,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":76,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":77,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":78,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":79,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":80,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":81,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":82,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":83,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":84,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":85,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":86,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":87,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":88,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":89,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":90,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":91,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":92,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":93,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":94,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":95,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":96,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":97,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":98,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":99,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":100,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":101,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":102,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":103,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":104,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":105,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":106,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":107,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":108,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":109,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":110,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":111,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":112,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":113,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":114,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":115,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":116,"uw":4,"rank":"global"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":115,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["Hassan is showing everyone Ginkgo Nut by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way.","Hassan traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","🍽️ Hassan checks the pantry before heading out, then hangs back. \"Shelves are full to bursting. Patching the boots today.\"","🍽️ Hassan carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\"","🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)","The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning.","— DAY 113 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there.","\"They're sending Vex after you tomorrow. He's bored. Be somewhere else.\"","(390 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)","💬 David mutters: \"Smile for the sky, they said. I hate how easy it was to start doing it.\"","Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","🌱 Hassan waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait.","🌿 Hassan checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~15 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep.","💧 Hassan returns with 12L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it.","You catch fragments by the fire — David telling Wei about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — the haven's talking about nothing else.","Back at the haven the argument starts: Roman is calling it \"Big Loud.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want.","📣 Roman stood down Chorus Line and kept walking. 8 rounds, 29 taken.","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 16L left.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Photo album. Faces from before. Esther's wedding. Your dad asleep in the chair. The neighbor's kid with the missing tooth. The most valuable thing you own, and it weighs nothing. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to creek.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to forest floor.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to creek.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","You walk back into Haven. 53 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","You coax 2 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)","📋 Hassan — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","Hassan speaks only 🇮🇳 Hindi. No shared words at all — just eyes, hands, and patience.","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","🪨 Hassan pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (516 stone now.)","You catch Wei telling the fire about Roman. \"Roman stood down Chorus Line and kept walking. 8 rounds, 29 taken.\" The story's already growing.","The table is being set — a lesser seat, priced for what you built. They are watching to see who comes to it.","◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn hotter from here.)","🐗 RAID — 3 raiders (The Loud Beast, The Herald, The Eulogy) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! The palisade's stakes take their toll as they come over the wall.","🐗⚠️ One of them is bigger than the usual teeth at the door — The Herald came with this raid, and the wall was not built for its kind.","🚨 The Loud Beast, The Herald, The Eulogy is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs.","Nobody met The Eulogy — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off.","🛡️ Hassan and Wei met them at the door — 1 driven off, 1 barely walked away. Wei is hurt.","The watch holds the wall. You sleep through the worst of it — or would have, if the shouting had let you.","Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain.","Village meal: +400 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","🩹 You make rounds — Wei gets bound up properly. (59 → 74 HP)","Wei paces the hall, restless, then sits. Then paces.","Hassan drew Wood Sorrel in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't.","🔍 Wei crouches over a tall weed with star-shaped leaves and spiny pods holding beautiful mottled beans, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)","Wei: \"Walked past a good stand of fonio. Worth remembering where.\"","Hassan and David lingered over the fire together.","🍽️ Hassan peeks into the pantry, then turns the foraging party back. \"Plenty for days. Teaching the kids snares instead — they'll need to know.\"","🍽️ Wei leaves the surplus by the fire for whoever's hungry. \"The pantry can't take it. We can.\"","🌿 Saw Palmetto — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens.","💡 Saw Palmetto: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click.","🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the west. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)","🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 0 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate.","— DAY 114 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","📯 It moves.","🌿 Hassan checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~14 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep.","🪵 Hassan hauls back 9 wood. The pile grows. (2662 logs now.)","You catch fragments by the fire — Hassan telling David about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning.","Wei heads out to forage. \"Gone looking. Don't wait up.\"","🧭 Roman is back from past the north (+3532 kcal for the pantry, 7 stories, a new scar) (Ask them what they saw.)","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","You catch fragments by the fire — David telling Hassan about Roman. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","🩹 Roman is hurting (58 HP) — You patch them up before they head out. (58 → 83 HP)","Roman heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","📯 It moves.","🌿 Wei returns from foraging the wilds: +222 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 222 kcal is eaten at the fire instead.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Photo album. Faces from before. Esther's wedding. Your dad asleep in the chair. The neighbor's kid with the missing tooth. The most valuable thing you own, and it weighs nothing. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to creek.","The Herald stops at the boundary — pacing, unwilling. Something else is already here. It's still out there.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to forest floor.","It followed you. The Loud Beast is here.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to creek.","It followed you. The Loud Beast is here.","📖 The Eulogy narrates: \"Wei faltered.\" (5 verses remain.)","📖 The Eulogy narrates: \"Wei faltered.\" (4 verses remain.)","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Eulogy: Contradict the narration. It is a STORY and stories need listeners — it narrates you faltering, and the verses count down. Contradict it with your actions: it says you run, you advance. Three true contradictions and the story dismisses you kindly. (It says you falter — do not.) (Wei lived to tell it, twice — the village pieced it together.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Contradict the narration — It is a STORY and stories need listeners — it narrates you faltering, and the verses count down. Contradict it with your actions: it says you run, you advance. Three true contradictions and the story dismisses you kindly. (It says you falter — do not.)","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Loud Beast stops at the boundary — pacing, unwilling. Something else is already here. It's still out there.","While you were gone — 5 things you missed:","⚔️ Hassan stared down the Loud Beast and it backed off — 0 rounds, not a scratch on them. It's still out there, somewhere.","🩸 The Herald mauled Wei (-41 health) over 2 rounds. They're lucky to be breathing.","🩸 The Herald mauled Hassan (-52 health) over 2 rounds. They're lucky to be breathing.","🩸 The Herald mauled Hassan (-27 health) over 1 round. They're lucky to be breathing. — staying out of sight for the rest of the day — too hurt to meet it again","🩸 The Eulogy mauled Wei (-56 health) over 2 rounds. They're lucky to be breathing.","You walk back into Haven. 53 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","📋 Hassan — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Wei — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part.","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","💧 Hassan returns with 14L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it.","🍲 Wei cooked for the haven — meals stretched.","💧 Roman returns with water: +3 clean.","Rosa waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Thornfield with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","📖 LEARNED: Grave Robber (Level 1). You can loot the dead (villagers, monsters). Good gear. -15 trust if seen.","◈ TRIAL COMPLETE — the audience applauds, which sounds like static. (+15 integration, gift: a lesson: Grave Robber)","🌙 Night. The lingering The Eulogy gorges at the treeline — 667 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big Loud.\" The Codex keeps it.","◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)","Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","🩹 You make rounds — Hassan gets bound up properly. (21 → 36 HP)","Quiet mending sounds from the bunks — Hassan fixing something.","Hassan came back with 360 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 180 kcal in, 180 kcal eaten at the fire.","Hassan and Roman lingered over the fire together.","🍽️ David stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\"","🍽️ Hassan leaves the surplus by the fire for whoever's hungry. \"The pantry can't take it. We can.\"","🌿 Kudzu Root — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens.","💡 Kudzu Root: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click.","— DAY 115 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","📦 A care package drops from the sky with a little parachute. There's a note: \"WE LOVE YOU! — your showbiz fans\"","Inside: Ghost Camo","Plus 50 kcal of fan-approved snacks.","💬 Roman says: \"My kid asked if the watchers have favorites. I didn't know what to tell her.\"","You wake with a start — something is wrong.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices