{"day":169,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":170,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":171,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":172,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":173,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":174,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":175,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":176,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":177,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":178,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":179,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":180,"uw":4,"rank":"global"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-late","day":157,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["Travel 1 tile to trail edge.","You catch fragments by the fire — Nora telling Rahul about themself. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.","It followed you. The Ugly-Eyes is here.","Something pads into the clearing — The Algorithm. It's here.","You work the patch with practiced hands: 13× Hickory Nuts (in shell — shell them to eat). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","\"Can't sleep,\" Rahul admits, sitting near you. \"Tell me something from before. Anything.\"","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Algorithm stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","You keep a day's food (1200 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking.","You walk back into Haven. 62 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","You sow Muscadine Grapes: 365 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning.","That goes on your melee, not your ranged.","You catch fragments by the fire — Onni telling Yara about himself. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind.","💧 Daniyar returns with water: +4 clean.","💧 Yara returns with water: +2 clean.","🐗 RAID — 3 raiders (Big-Eyes, The Herald, The Algorithm) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! The palisade's stakes take their toll as they come over the wall.","🐗⚠️ One of them is bigger than the usual teeth at the door — The Herald came with this raid, and the wall was not built for its kind.","🚨 Big-Eyes, The Herald, The Algorithm is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs.","Nobody met Big-Eyes — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off.","Nobody met The Herald — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off.","Nobody met The Algorithm — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off.","The watch holds the wall. You sleep through the worst of it — or would have, if the shouting had let you.","Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started.","Village meal: +2200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","🩹 You make rounds — Tom gets bound up properly. (69 → 84 HP)","Yara came back with 368 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes.","Onni and Iván lingered over the fire together.","Daniyar and Onni lingered over the fire together.","🍽️ Tom rests a hand on the pantry door, satisfied. \"No one's going hungry this week. Sitting with the fever cases instead — someone should.\"","🍽️ Yara taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\"","🌿 Moringa — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens.","💡 Moringa: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click.","💧 The cistern's recovered — full cups again, and nobody's guarding the dipper.","The garden: your untended Muscadine Grapes drowned in weeds and died. (Six untended days. The garden keeps honest books.)","The garden is going weedy — your Muscadine Grapes needs tending, or the harvest halves.","The first night of Spring. A day ends at the fire; a season ends there too, only longer. The village sits up late.","Behind us: Winter. The boss. Nuts and stored food or nothing. Game gets bold. The Codex grew this season — 60 new: Guava, Mahua, Saw Palmetto (+57 more).","The season took Howard, Sidney, Nessa. Their names are spoken, then the fire is quiet a while.","Spring is coming. Around the fire, the gaps show: nobody here knows Boiling Water — and the season will ask.","— DAY 156 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","👀 Iván let a place-name slip — somewhere that isn't Denver — then covered it with \"Denver\" so fast the cover was louder than the slip.","◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from The Bloodied bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Feared. The show's narration lingers on your hands.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","That goes on your melee, not your ranged.","💧 Rahul returns with water: +4 clean.","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Tom heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","Word with the traders: Stonebridge door is clear again. Whatever had them, let go.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","That goes on your melee, not your ranged.","Rahul heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","💧 Nora returns with water: +4 clean.","👥 Daniyar heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","👥 Nora walks out with Daniyar. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","Yara is sweeping the hall. Someone has to.","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Photo album. Faces from before. Jagoda's wedding. Your dad asleep in the chair. The neighbor's kid with the missing tooth. The most valuable thing you own, and it weighs nothing. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","Something pads into the clearing — Big-Eyes. It's here.","You catch fragments by the fire — Yara telling Iván about Onni. The retelling is already better than the event.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to wetland.","You work the patch with practiced hands: 6× Spicebush (180 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","You keep a day's food (1200 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 62 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","You sow Muscadine Grapes: 365 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","💧 Onni returns with water: +4 clean.","💧 Tom returns with water: +3 clean.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it.","Daniyar showed Nora the big heart-shaped leaves on stalks, like elephant ears — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools.","💧 Rahul returns with water: +3 clean.","🌙 Night. The lingering Big-Eyes gorges at the treeline — 1,400 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,000 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Algorithm gorges at the treeline — 1,000 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","★ IDENTIFIED: Colocasia (Arbi). Arbi (colocasia/taro). The corm is potato-like — once you cook the sting out. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn.","SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth.","📚 Village knowledge: Yara taught everyone about Colocasia (Arbi). The Codex grows without you lifting a finger.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started.","Village meal: +2468 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","Daniyar is humming something. It stops when they notice you listening.","Rahul has been asking about the strange leaves all week — \"but what IS it?\" Tonight, an answer. Yara is showing everyone Colocasia (Arbi) by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way.","🔍 Yara crouches over tall tree, grey bark, five-lobed leaves that flame orange in fall, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)","◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Yara — Field 1. Three offers; they took Echo Location. Earned, chosen. (echo_location: villager level-up)","📓 Codex: Yara chose Echo Location (echo_location) at Field 1.","Yara had the day of their life — 1102 kcal. Two days of food from one person.","Tom and Onni lingered over the fire together.","Yara and Rahul lingered over the fire together.","🍽️ Yara surveys the stacked shelves and nods. \"The wild can rest. Splitting firewood instead — winter comes whether we like it or not.\"","🍽️ Yara sets the sharing basket down by the fire instead of the pantry. \"Full shelves don't need my little more.\"","The garden: your untended Muscadine Grapes drowned in weeds and died. (Six untended days. The garden keeps honest books.)","The moment passed. Nobody mentions the pods today. A few people notice that nobody mentions them.","— DAY 157 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Colocasia (Arbi) — named and noted.","📦 Your showbiz fans voted: a wacky curio, gift-wrapped, no note. The note would have explained it. There is no note.","💬 Aki says: \"Do you think they're watching right now? The... audience? I try not to think about it.\"","Dawn. You wake rested. (+3 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","That goes on your melee, not your ranged.","A sweet smell, suddenly strong. The warts seem to lean toward you.","🍄 It moves.","The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline.","⚔ BIG-EYES! You're on your own.","Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act.","Onni squares up to watch. \"Give it hell.\"","🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer.","(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")","👥 Rahul sets out to find Nora. \"Won't be long.\"","👥 Onni walks out with Rahul. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","🚶 Nora is back with Daniyar.","💧 Daniyar returns with water: +3 clean.","👥 Yara heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","👥 Nora walks out with Yara. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","(cap's hide absorbs 1.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","cap is hurt bad — and it knows it. Wild swings, everything committed, nothing held back. Dangerous and sloppy.","You STRIKE the cap for 34 (Stone knife).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","💥 Sporefall!","Armor absorbs 7.","Cap's Sporefall hits you for 6.","📖 Codex: Sporefall — hits everything close around it. You won't forget this.","(cap's hide absorbs 1.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","The Big-Eyes falls.","You STRIKE the cap for 33 (Stone knife).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📺 +20 style — dropped the Big-Eyes!","Do not eat the monster mushroom. The flesh is ibotenic sponge — the spores alone are a trip you don't come back from.","You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire.","That goes on your melee, not your ranged.","Nora left 2 wood logs by the stash. No announcement. That's how it works here.","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","📯 It moves.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":157,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":88,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":97,"opinion":26,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":8,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":62,"opinion":12,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","tru