onal"},{"day":61,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":62,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":63,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":64,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":65,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":66,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":67,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":68,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":69,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":70,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":71,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":72,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":73,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":74,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":75,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":76,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":77,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":78,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":79,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":80,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":81,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":82,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":83,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":84,"uw":3,"rank":"national"},{"day":85,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":86,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":87,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":88,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":89,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":90,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":91,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":92,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":93,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":94,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":95,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":96,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":97,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":98,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":99,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":100,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":101,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":102,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":103,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":104,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":105,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":106,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":107,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":108,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":109,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":110,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":111,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":112,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":113,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":114,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":115,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":116,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":117,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":118,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":119,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":120,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":121,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":122,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":123,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":124,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":125,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":126,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":127,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":128,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":129,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":130,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":131,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":132,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":133,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":134,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":135,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":136,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":137,"uw":3,"rank":"global"},{"day":138,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":139,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":140,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":141,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":142,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":143,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":144,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":145,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":146,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":147,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":148,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":149,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":150,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":151,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":152,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":153,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":154,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":155,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":156,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":157,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":158,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":159,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":160,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":161,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":162,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":163,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":164,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":165,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":166,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":167,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":168,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":169,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":170,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":171,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":172,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":173,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":174,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":175,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":176,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":177,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":178,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":179,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":180,"uw":4,"rank":"global"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-late","day":180,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","You keep a day's food (450 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 65 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","💬 Blanca: \"Stay close, yeah?\"","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","You sow Burdock: 90 days to first harvest. Harvest removes the crop; sow new seed afterward. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","Your slots are full (6/6). Choose which ability Loud Chewer replaces — or keep what you have.","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","💧 Nathan returns with water: +3 clean.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to.","You catch fragments by the fire — Blanca telling Rocco about Elias. The retelling is already better than the event.","You catch fragments by the fire — Marcus telling Devon about Nathan. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","💧 Blanca returns with water: +3 clean.","🚶 Frank is back with Devon.","🚶 Rocco is back with Blanca.","💧 Devon returns with water: +3 clean.","💧 Jesse returns with water: +4 clean.","🚶 Nadia is back with Jesse.","💧 Liam returns with water: +3 clean.","Rosa waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Hungry Road with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Big Beast gorges at the treeline — 1,176 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Eulogy gorges at the treeline — 990 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,188 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","They come fast and scared — a family, or what's left of one. \"Please. We heard you take people in.\" Behind them, something worse than weather.","A cold snap. Breath smokes. The woods go quiet.","Village meal: +198 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","Quiet mending sounds from the bunks — Elias fixing something.","◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Liam — Field 2. Three offers; they took Dowsing. Earned, chosen. (dowsing: villager level-up)","📓 Codex: Liam chose Dowsing (dowsing) at Field 2.","Liam came back with 677 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 339 kcal in, 338 kcal eaten at the fire.","Liam traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","Nadia and Rocco lingered over the fire together.","Liam and Nadia lingered over the fire together.","🍽️ Liam takes one look at the full shelves and unshoulders the pack. \"Leave the wild standing. Hauling water for the cistern.\"","🍽️ Blanca carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\"","💧 The cistern's recovered — full cups again, and nobody's guarding the dipper.","🌙 Raid — The Red Table came in the night from the south. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)","— DAY 179 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","📦 A care package drops from the sky with a little parachute. There's a note: \"WE LOVE YOU! — your showbiz fans\"","Inside: Wrong bandage","Plus 31 kcal of fan-approved snacks.","A hard frost tonight. (16°C — Mild) Everything crackles by dawn.","Whatever was at the door has moved on — or found easier meat. The call goes quiet.","You wake with a start — something is wrong.","📖 LEARNED: Brawler's Instinct (Level 1). You read a fight as it moves. The body tells you what the mouth won't.","📈 Combat 2: the work taught you Brawler's Instinct.","Eagle eyes found the herd; pathfinder legs ate the miles between. By the time anyone asked where you were going, you were already there.","Something wants to happen when you do... whatever you just did. (2/3)","Spot it first. Then close the distance.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","You catch fragments by the fire — Blanca telling Elias about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind.","You catch fragments by the fire — Liam telling Nathan about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions.","You catch fragments by the fire — Blanca telling Rocco about Nathan. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning.","👥 Blanca heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\"","👥 Nadia walks out with Blanca. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","🩹 Liam is hurting (40 HP) — Frank patches them up before they head out. (40 → 65 HP)","👥 Frank heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","👥 Liam walks out with Frank. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","💧 Marcus returns with water: +2 clean.","🚶 Elias is back with Marcus.","Nathan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Jesse heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","👥 Marcus walks out with Jesse. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","Devon is sweeping the hall. Someone has to.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","You catch fragments by the fire — Frank telling Jesse about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do.","You catch fragments by the fire — Rocco telling Jesse about Blanca. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater.","👥 Rocco heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","👥 Elias walks out with Rocco. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","🍖 FEAST 📺 — Joshua opens the pantry wide: 8× Foraged food. Devon eat until the fire burns low. Nobody talks much. It isn't plenty — but it's warm, and everybody's here. (−1,600 kcal from the pantry) The channeled keepsake feeds the feast — the feast was the weapon, and the surge rides the fire until tomorrow's dawn, spent only when the blades are warmed. (FEAST SURGE ×1.5 armed)","🍖 The feast is warm and good — but your reactor hums its steady note underneath, and the fire never catches. 1.25x, always, is all there is. (Feast buff refused: the reactor is a ceiling as well as a floor.)","💧 Nathan returns with water: +2 clean.","Devon heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\"","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Photo Album. Faces from before. Amanda's wedding. Your dad asleep in the chair. The neighbor's kid with the missing tooth. The most valuable thing you own, and it weighs nothing. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to creek.","It followed you. The Big Beast is here.","You catch fragments by the fire — Jesse telling Devon about Elias. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","You catch fragments by the fire — Marcus telling Jesse about you. The retelling is already better than the event.","💬 Blanca: \"Smell that? Something's different here.\"","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to forest floor.","It followed you. The Big Beast is here.","💬 Blanca: \"Stay close, yeah?\"","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.","It followed you. The Big Beast is here.","Birds scatter in a sudden hush — something is moving out there. You give it a wide berth.","💬 Blanca: \"Smell that? Something's different here.\"","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","You keep a day's food (270 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 65 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","You sow Burdock: 90 days to first harvest. Harvest removes the crop; sow new seed afterward. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","📋 Frank — 🎣 Fish. Frank nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part.","Your slots are full (6/6). Choose which ability Loud Chewer replaces — or keep what you have.","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","You catch fragments by the fire — Marcus telling Nadia about Elias. It's picking up decorations as it travels.","You catch fragments by the fire — Marcus telling Jesse about Rocco. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning.","💧 Rocco returns with water: +3 clean.","🚶 Marcus is back with Jesse.","🚶 Elias is back with Rocco.","💧 Jesse returns with water: +4 clean.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","It's settled. The village is calling it \"Ugly-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it.","◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)","Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","Frank came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)","Nadia came back with 679 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 340 kcal in, 339 kcal eaten at the fire.","🍽️ Rocco surveys the stacked shelves and nods. \"The wild can rest. Splitting firewood instead — winter comes whether we like it or not.\"","🍽️ Nadia leaves the surplus by the fire for whoever's hungry. \"The pantry can't take it. We can.\"","🌿 Bilberry — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens.","💡 Bilberry: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click.","💧 The cistern won't cover today — the hall's call, no vote needed: half rations until the water runs come back.","The garden is going weedy — your Burdock needs tending, or the harvest halves.","— DAY 180 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Overnight, Hickory Nuts (in shell) went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies.","Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last.","◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from Emberhold bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Feared. The show's narration lingers on your hands.","Dawn. You wake rested. (+30 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","👂 Overheard — Blanca: \"If we rotate the watch, nobody pulls two nights running. Fair's fair.\"","👂 Overheard — Nathan: \"Okay — what's the first step?\"","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","📯 It moves.","\"Can we talk?\" Nathan sighs. \"I need some space. A corner nobody needs me in. Is that okay?\" (Talk to Nathan.)","You catch fragments by the fire — Blanca telling Nathan about Devon. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind.","💧 Blanca returns with water: +2 clean.","💧 Frank returns with water: +3 clean.","👥 Marcus heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","👥 Elias walks out with Marcus. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","💧 Devon returns with water: +4 clean.","🚶 Nadia is back with Blanca.","🚶 Liam is back with Frank.","🎒 Frank is leaving — not foraging. Really leaving. \"I'll bring back something worth the walk.\"","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":180,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":172,"links":[{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":100,"opinion":64,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":100,"opinion":31,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_spl_32_30129","name":"The Red Table II","trust":100,"opinion":54,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":4,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":4}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":4,"callOffered":true,"commitOffered":true,"volunteers":6,"out