ows — the string stays drawn, useless.","Alfonso's gear absorbs 16.","R1: First Omen hits Alfonso for 18 (82 left)","R1: Alfonso strikes for 10 (515 left)","Alfonso's gear absorbs 20.","R2: Second Omen hits Alfonso for 24 (58 left)","R2: Alfonso strikes for 12 (503 left)","Alfonso sees how this ends — and runs while running still works."]}],"kills":[],"musterEvents":[],"census":[{"day":2,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":2,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":4,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":4,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":5,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":6,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":7,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":8,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":9,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":10,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":11,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":12,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":13,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":14,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":15,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":16,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":17,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":18,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":19,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":20,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":21,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":22,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":23,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":24,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":25,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":26,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":27,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":28,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":29,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":30,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":31,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":32,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":33,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":34,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":35,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":36,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":37,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":38,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":39,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":40,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":41,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":42,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":43,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":44,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":45,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":46,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":47,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":48,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":49,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":50,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":51,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":52,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":53,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":54,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":55,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":56,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":57,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":58,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":59,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":60,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":61,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":62,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":63,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":64,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":65,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":66,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":67,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":68,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":69,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":70,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":71,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":72,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":73,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":74,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":75,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":76,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":77,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":78,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":79,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":80,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":81,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":82,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":83,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":84,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":85,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":86,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":87,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":88,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":89,"uw":4,"rank":"global"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":86,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["You STRIKE the king for 18 (Sharpened stick).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","(king's hide absorbs 2.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","The Big Big falls.","You STRIKE the king for 18 (Sharpened stick).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📺 +20 style — dropped the Big Big!","The crown is bone and vanity, but the haunches are venison fit for a king. Literally. It's dead. The carcass is there on the ground — search the body if you want the meat. But you don't know this flesh. Clean it, test it cautiously, or ask someone who knows. And don't leave it long: meat rots where it lies.","You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire.","You clutch your Dad's Thermos. You're still here. The resonance deepens. (bond 0)","It sits up on its hind legs, hands moving too fast to follow. It's trying to figure out your pack.","It chitters — offended. Those clever hands curl into fists.","Peyton heads out to forage. \"Bringing dinner back. One way or another.\"","💧 Katarina returns with water: +4 clean.","Rosa heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\"","Adaeze heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","🍖 FEAST 📺 — Elijah opens the pantry wide: 13× Cattail. Katarina, Alfonso eat until the fire burns low. Nobody talks much. It isn't plenty — but it's warm, and everybody's here. (−1,560 kcal from the pantry) The channeled keepsake feeds the feast — the feast was the weapon, and the surge rides the fire until tomorrow's dawn, spent only when the blades are warmed. (FEAST SURGE ×1.5 armed)","🍖 The feast is warm and good — but your reactor hums its steady note underneath, and the fire never catches. 1.25x, always, is all there is. (Feast buff refused: the reactor is a ceiling as well as a floor.)","It sits up on its hind legs — hands moving too fast to follow. It's not looking at you. It's looking at your pack.","(It steals FIRST. Guard your things — or buy it off with food.)","The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline.","⚔ BIG-EYES! You're on your own.","Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act.","Katarina doesn't look away. \"About time someone fought back.\"","It circles once, eyes never leaving your pack — those hands never stop moving.","🖐️ Its hands blur — and suddenly it's holding your Sharpened stick! It's already running.","🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer.","(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")","You toss Cattail. It CANNOT resist — drops your Sharpened stick mid-scamper and stuffs its cheeks instead.","📺 +10 style — bought off the thief","It got away. No meat, no trophy — but you're breathing, and now you know its moves.","The water stills. A faint crackling rises — the hairs on your arms lift. This is the warning.","\"Can't sleep,\" Katarina admits, sitting near you. \"Tell me something from before. Anything.\"","⚡ It moves.","The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline.","⚔ THE UGLY BEAST! Katarina joins you!","Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act.","Katarina plants their feet. \"Finally. A fight worth watching.\"","Katarina strikes the Ugly Beast.","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): Katarina fights on a full belly.","Katarina hits eel for 13.","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Katarina.","🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer.","(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")","You catch fragments by the fire — Katarina telling Peyton about Wei. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning.","💧 Wei returns with water: +3 clean.","Katarina sets out to find Elijah. \"Won't be long.\"","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it.","Katarina strikes the Ugly Beast.","Katarina hits eel for 8.","Too close. The eel's attention SNAPS to you — proximity overrules patience.","Katarina strikes the Ugly Beast.","Katarina hits eel for 10.","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Katarina.","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","eel is hurt bad — and it knows it. Wild swings, everything committed, nothing held back. Dangerous and sloppy.","You STRIKE the eel for 19 (Sharpened stick).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on you.","Too close. The eel's attention SNAPS to Katarina — proximity overrules patience.","💥 Full Discharge!","Armor absorbs 13.","Eel's Full Discharge hits you for 8.","Katarina's gear absorbs 7.","Eel's Full Discharge hits Katarina for 9.","📖 Codex: Full Discharge — hits everything close around it. You won't forget this.","Katarina strikes the Ugly Beast.","Katarina hits eel for 8.","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","The Ugly Beast falls.","You STRIKE the eel for 24 (Sharpened stick).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on you.","📺 +20 style — dropped the Ugly Beast!","Katarina whoops. \"That's how it's done!\"","Long muscle, barely a bone in it. Roast it well — and make sure it's actually dead first. It can twitch a shock out for a while after. It's dead. The carcass is there on the ground — search the body if you want the meat. But you don't know this flesh. Clean it, test it cautiously, or ask someone who knows. And don't leave it long: meat rots where it lies.","You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire.","You clutch your Dad's Thermos. You're still here. The resonance deepens. (bond 0)","💛 You hold Dad's Thermos. Dad tapped it twice before the first sip, every morning, like knocking before entering the day. You do it too now. Some mornings it's the only conversation you have. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to trail edge.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","You catch fragments by the fire — Peyton telling Ava about themself. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to meadow.","★★ MASTERY: Purslane. Mastery: pick before flowering for best texture. Regrows fast — cut, don't pull. (Yield 2x)","SYSTEM: You know this plant the way it knows itself. Concerning. Impressive.","You work the patch with practiced hands: 7× Purslane, 11× Cattail (1530 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The pantry is bursting past tomorrow — most of the haul stays in your pack. The fire can wait; the road can't.","You keep a day's food (6000 kcal) and unload 7920 kcal into Haven's pantry.","You walk back into Haven. 45 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","Donated Purslane (+90 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this.","Donated Cattail (+3480 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)","🌾 Haven sends 1,560 kcal of grain to The Red Table III's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","🚶 Ava is back — found Elijah.","💧 Adaeze returns with water: +4 clean.","📖 LEARNED: Draw Fire (Level 1). In the wilds, beside your people, you make yourself the problem. Shout, wave, bleed loudly — the beast's eye stays on you and off them. Monsters focus you instead of your allies.","📺 Strangers paint your face on their walls. In other villages. Villages you've never been to.","◈ TRIAL COMPLETE — the audience applauds, which sounds like static. (+15 integration, gift: a lesson: Draw Fire)","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,200 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering Spool gorges at the treeline — 1,397 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","Village meal: +360 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","Kyle and Peyton are arguing about the watch rotation. Again. It's almost comforting.","Ingrid is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 80/100)","Alfonso and Kyle lingered over the fire together.","🍽️ Peyton surveys the stacked shelves and nods. \"The wild can rest. Splitting firewood instead — winter comes whether we like it or not.\"","🍽️ Kyle looks at the full shelves and waves off the day's share. \"No more into the store — we eat at the fire, and the shelves keep.\"","📓 Codex: Wei taught Alfonso Field Dressing.","🌿 Cattail, weeks in the baskets. Handling it day after day, the village has learned what it's FOR — not just what it is. The village knows its uses now.","🌿 Soursop, weeks in the baskets. Handling it day after day, the village has learned what it's FOR — not just what it is. The village knows its uses now.","💡 Soursop: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/2) and it'll click.","— DAY 86 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Overnight, Cattail went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies.","Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last.","The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Purslane — mastered.","🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there.","\"Cache by the hollow. Dried meat, clean water. I can't stay. — W.\"","(427 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)","Dawn. You wake rested. (+22 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","📯 It moves.","Wei heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","💧 Rosa returns with water: +4 clean.","Ava heads out to check the snares. \"Wire doesn't lie.\"","Kyle heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","Riders from The Red Table: something's at THEIR door now. They can't spare anyone — and they wanted Haven to know first.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","🌿 Peyton returns from foraging the wilds: +209 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 209 kcal is eaten at the fire instead.","Rosa sets out for Big Big. \"Meat's meat. Back with it or not at all.\"","Adaeze sets out for Big Big. \"Meat's meat. Back with it or not at all.\"","Alfonso is crouched over the embers, blowing soft, one hand blocking the draft.","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 3L left.","Peyton left 2 branches by the stash. No announcement. That's how it works here.","📯 It moves.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":86,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not 